  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1 Launch VRChat\n\n2 Open the text box—either via \"Search Worlds\" or \"Chat\" is fine.\n\n3 Click the \"X\" at the top right of the text box, or click the small \"X\" on the right side inside the text box.\n\n4 VRChat stops accepting left-clicks and keyboard text input, and the issue is not resolved until VRChat is force-closed.\n\n（In rare cases, simply opening the text box triggers the same bug.）\n\n（The bug does not necessarily occur with a single action; it may happen after pressing the \"X\" mark or opening the text box several times.）",
